@description ReaAnimViewer
@version 0.0.0
@noindex
@author Anthony Deneyer
@about
  # ReaAnimViewer

  3D animation viewer for REAPER. Load glTF and FBX animations onto your timeline
  and watch the animated character play in sync with the playhead, from any camera angle.

  - Drop a `.glb`, `.gltf` or `.fbx` file on a track: it becomes an item the length of the animation.
  - Run the action **RAV: Open Viewer** to open the dockable viewer.
  - Orbit, pan and zoom freely while the animation follows the transport.

  Windows 64-bit only. Nothing else to install. Restart REAPER after installing or updating.
@links
  GitHub https://github.com/OWNER/REPO
